@startuml
title KanbanFlow Unreleased Source Changes
left to right direction
rectangle "Published baseline\nv1.1.0" as B
rectangle "Later committed main\nStyling and documentation" as M
rectangle "Exact comparison and fresh checks" as C
rectangle "Future version decision" as V
rectangle "Authorized tag and release" as R
B --> M
M --> C
C ..> V : candidate review
V ..> R : only when approved
note bottom of M
Committed and pushed is not published as a new version.
No membership-policy fix is implied.
end note
@enduml